Amazon is a massive global technology and e-commerce company that sells consumer goods online, provides cloud computing services, and develops digital devices and artificial intelligence.
Core Services and Business AreasE-Commerce Marketplace: Operates as the world's largest online retailer, selling millions of products directly and hosting third-party sellers.
Amazon Web Services (AWS): A leading cloud computing platform that powers a large portion of the modern internet infrastructure.
Digital Devices and AI: Manufactures popular consumer hardware like Kindle e-readers, Fire TV sticks, Echo smart speakers, and runs the Alexa voice assistant.
Entertainment and Streaming: Offers video streaming through Prime Video and audiobooks through Audible.
